        "title": "Six linked sites, not the entire Normandy coast",
        "summary": "The inscription covers a serial cultural property spread across about 80 kilometers of coastline, pairing the five named landing beaches with Pointe du Hoc. It also recognizes surviving military, archaeological and memorial landscapes associated with the landings.",
